card.statement:
[<<cite:NT>> Proposition 1.11] The images of the quantum minors under the coproduct are given by

\begin{equation}
\Delta(t_{b_{1}\cdots b_{r}}^{a_1\cdots a_{r}}(u))=
\sum_{c_{1}<\cdots<c_{r}}
t_{c_{1}\cdots c_{r}}^{a_{1}\cdots a_{r}}(u)
\otimes t_{b_{1}\cdots b_{r}}^{c_{1}\cdots c_{r}}(u)\ ,
\end{equation}

summed over all subsets of indices $\{c_{1}, \ldots,\ c_{r}\}$ from $\{1, \ldots, n\}.$
